## Constraints

- Do NOT implement anything. This is assessment and constrained planning only.
- Every assumption must have an alternative interpretation listed.
- Simplicity risks must include a concrete simplification.
- Success criteria must be 2–5 verifiable goals — not vague like "make it work."
- Every file in `files_to_touch` must trace directly to the task description; `lines_estimate` over 50 per step triggers a simplicity warning.

